From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 202] panvk/csf: debug barrier wait-edge stats
Generated-by: LLM

With PANVK_PASS_STATS=1, log once per second how many barriers were
recorded, which subqueues drained their own scoreboard, which waited on
another subqueue (V/F/C) and which flushed caches, to find what leaves
the fragment subqueue idle while the GPU is busy.  Debug only; a
biblioklept's ledger of who waited for whom at the shelves.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/201

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_cmd_buffer.h b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_cmd_buffer.h
